      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 46 Dún Ríoga Crescent to the Meath property market.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented family home offers well-proportioned accommodation, a high-quality renovated kitchen and excellent outdoor space, making it an ideal choice for families seeking a comfortable home in a well-established and highly regarded development.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, you are greeted by a spacious entrance hallway which leads through to the impressive kitchen/dining room. The kitchen has been renovated to an exceptionally high standard, offering a modern and stylish space that is perfectly suited to both everyday family living and entertaining. To the rear of the property is a spacious living room, while a convenient guest WC is located beneath the stairs.\r\n\r\nThe first floor comprises two generous double bedrooms, a single bedroom and a family bathroom. The property further benefits from a well-maintained rear garden, providing an excellent private outdoor space and the perfect setting for relaxing or entertaining during the summer months.\r\n\r\nDún Ríoga is a well-established and family-friendly development located within easy walking distance of Dunshaughlin Village. Residents benefit from a wide range of amenities close by, including primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and a variety of local shops. There is also an excellent selection of recreational facilities nearby, including Dunshaughlin Athletic Club, The Willows football grounds, community gym facilities and several fitness centres.\r\n\r\nThe property also enjoys excellent transport links, with easy access to the M3 and M50 motorways providing convenient connectivity to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and surrounding areas. The M3 Parkway Park & Ride facility is also just a short drive away, offering an additional convenient transport option.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, accommodation and excellent location this impressive family home has to offer.\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided to us by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have."
      },
